  "reason": "The only completed experiment is a modest RNA-only single-profile PCA baseline (accuracy 0.4849, F1 0.4639), leaving large uncertainty about whether image features are useful at all. config_010 tests an image-only single-profile ResNet50 baseline, isolating the modality choice with a simple unimodal model and no aggregation or fusion confounds. This is the best next experiment because it establishes the image performance reference needed to decide whether to exploit image/multimodal directions or focus on RNA representation and profile choices, while avoiding premature testing of more complex multimodal configurations."
